  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.3.0:\n      - Adds the AstraFlow.Testing package.\n      - Includes fake sender, fake publisher, fake mediator, request/notification recording, handler and pipeline harnesses, mapper/projection assertions, and a deterministic test secure ID codec.\n      - Keeps testing helpers framework-neutral with no xUnit, NUnit, MSTest, or mocking-framework dependency.\n      - Ships AstraFlow.Testing assets for netstandard2.0, net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0.\n      - See CHANGELOG.md for the full release history.",
